<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">FAMILY CONNECTION</view><view class="title">家庭健康共享</view><view class="desc">亲近需要尊重边界；授权由居民主动决定，随时可以撤回。</view>
<block wx:if="{{role==='resident'}}"><view class="card"><view class="card-title">授权给家属</view><view class="desc">请向家属获取其个人邀请码，选择共享范围和有效期限。心理/情绪问卷答案永不包含在授权范围内。</view><view class="label">家属邀请码</view><input class="input" value="{{inviteCode}}" bindinput="changeInvite" maxlength="32" placeholder="请输入家属页面显示的邀请码"/><view class="checkbox-row" bindtap="toggleProfile"><checkbox checked="{{canProfile}}" color="#176956"/>共享基本档案（含姓名、年龄等）</view><view class="checkbox-row" bindtap="toggleVitals"><checkbox checked="{{canVitals}}" color="#176956"/>共享健康测量记录</view><view class="label">授权期限</view><picker range="{{durations}}" range-key="label" bindchange="chooseDuration"><view class="select">{{durations[durationIndex].label}} ▾</view></picker><button class="btn primary" bindtap="grant">确认授权家属</button></view>
<view class="section-title">已发起的授权</view><view class="card"><view wx:for="{{grants}}" wx:key="id" class="item row"><view><view class="item-title">{{item.grantee_name}}</view><view class="item-sub">{{item.can_profile?'基本档案 ':''}}{{item.can_vitals?'健康数据':''}}</view><view class="item-sub">到期：{{item.expiration}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{item.revoked_at}}" class="muted">已撤回</view><button wx:else class="btn small" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="revoke">撤回</button></view><view wx:if="{{!grants.length}}" class="empty">暂无授权记录</view></view></block>
<block wx:elif="{{role==='family'}}"><view class="summary"><view style="font-size:24rpx;color:#cce6d8">我的家庭邀请码</view><view style="font-size:37rpx;font-weight:700;word-break:break-all;letter-spacing:1rpx;margin:18rpx 0">{{myCode}}</view><view class="desc">将此邀请码告知想主动向您共享健康信息的家人。</view><button class="btn" bindtap="copyCode">复制邀请码</button></view>
<view class="section-title">家人共享给我的档案</view><view class="card"><view wx:for="{{shared}}" wx:key="resident_id" class="item row"><view><view class="item-title">{{item.name}}</view><view class="item-sub">{{item.can_profile?'基本信息 ':''}}{{item.can_vitals?'健康记录':''}}</view></view><button wx:if="{{item.can_vitals}}" class="btn small" data-id="{{item.resident_id}}" bindtap="viewVitals">查看数据</button></view><view wx:if="{{!shared.length}}" class="empty">暂无家庭授权。请将邀请码交给家人，由其本人主动授权。</view></view></block>
<view wx:else class="card"><view class="card-title">您尚未建立家庭成员身份</view><view class="desc">未建档的居民账号可以转换为家属身份；此操作不自动获得任何人的数据查看权限。</view><button class="btn primary" bindtap="familyMode">切换为家属身份</button></view>
<view class="hint">如遇紧急疾病状况请立即联系医生或急救机构。本系统并非实时生命体征监护。</view><button wx:if="{{role==='family'}}" class="btn" bindtap="logout">退出登录</button></view>
